lass="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What are the working hours for the role?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier working hours can be flexible depending on factors such as your availability, the location of your round, and the number of parcels that particular round generates. On average a courier works approximately 5-6 hours a day. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howwillibepaid" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howwillibepaid" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How will I be paid?-open answer" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How will I be paid?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howwillibepaid" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howwillibepaid" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers are paid on a monthly basis via BACS. All payments made by Evri to the courier will be without deductions of things like income tax for which you are responsible. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Invoices are accessible through the dedicated link in the Courier Community App. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doineedadditionalinsurance" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doineedadditionalinsurance" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Do I need additional insurance?-open answer" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do I need additional insurance?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doineedadditionalinsurance" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doineedadditionalinsurance" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier you must have the correct level of 3rd party cover whilst you’re out making deliveries. Evri has developed a ‘top-up’ insurance with Marsh Insurance. Charged at £1.35 per day and only on the days that service is provided to Evri, this gives the 3rd party cover required for Self Employed Couriers whilst making deliveries and collections on behalf of Evri and our clients. (full details can be provided upon request). <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-cantfindyourquestionhere" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-cantfindyourquestionhere" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can&#39;t find your question here?-open answer" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can&#39;t find your question here?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-cantfindyourquestionhere" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-cantfindyourquestionhere" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/become-a-courier-faq" rel="no